Ryme debuted in the . She was first seen in Montenevera, where she was ordered by the to monitor , who had been deemed potentially dangerous for illegally enrolling into Uva Academy under a false identity. She was conflicted, as she had already agreed to her sister's request to help Scarlet find information on the Ruinous Pokémon.

Later, at the entrance to Montenevera, found Ryme standing near a group of unconscious Eeveelutions. Nemona theorized the Pokémon belonged to Penny, a girl she saw being taken away by some s shortly before she arrived. After a conversation with Cassiopeia, Nemona learned that the kidnapping victim as actually Scarlet disguised as Penny and she was taken to North Province (Area Two). Nemona immediately tried to go save her friend, but was warned by Ryme and Grusha that traversing Glaseado Mountain by herself could be dangerous. Ryme had Grusha safely transport Nemona down the mountain.
